sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant F as Fulfilment
  participant S as LockerService
  participant P as PackagingService
  participant A as LockerAssigner
  participant R as LockerRepository
  participant C as Carrier
  participant E as LockerEvents
  participant N as CustomerNotifier
  F->>S: assignLockers(order)
  S->>P: pack(order)
  P-->>S: Package[] (R2, R4)
  loop each package
    S->>A: assign(location, dims, lockerPackageId)
    A->>R: findAvailable(location)
    A->>R: book(lockerId, version, id)  %% compare-and-set (R9)
    R-->>A: true / false → next candidate
    A-->>S: Locker (BOOKED)
  end
  S-->>F: LockerPackage[] (BOOKED)
  C->>S: deliver(lockerPackageId)
  S->>S: lockerPackage.deliver(now) → code, validTill = now + 3d (R5, R6)
  S->>R: occupy(lockerId)
  S->>E: emit PackageDelivered
  E->>N: PackageDelivered
  N-->>F: email: locker, code, deadline
